WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.432 --> 00:00:04.634
Glen started rocking the canoe back and forth.

2
00:00:04.654 --> 00:00:05.275
"Everyone ready?"

3
00:00:05.295 --> 00:00:07.096
Splash! "This water is fr-freezing!"

4
00:00:07.917 --> 00:00:08.257
Ivy shouted.

5
00:00:08.297 --> 00:00:12.260
"Ack! The paddles are floating away!"

6
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:12.760
Ezra said.

7
00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:32.081
The kids swam to the capsized canoe.

8
00:00:33.161 --> 00:00:35.963
They tried climbing on it, but it was very slippery.

9
00:00:35.983 --> 00:00:40.284
"We're failing this test," Ivy said.

10
00:00:41.885 --> 00:00:44.286
The Blue team swiftly paddled their canoe over.

11
00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:48.428
Inside were Annie, Wes Wheezer, and Richard.

12
00:00:49.688 --> 00:00:51.449
"Swim under the canoe."

13
00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:55.651
Annie sneezed a few times.

14
00:00:55.671 --> 00:00:58.372
"Then lift it up and flip it over."

15
00:00:59.616 --> 00:01:01.997
The Yellow team managed to follow her instructions.

16
00:01:06.658 --> 00:01:08.198
job!" Richard said.

17
00:01:09.439 --> 00:01:11.679
Next, Annie told them how to get back in.

18
00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:16.881
They all climbed in, but the canoe was half-filled with water.

19
00:01:16.901 --> 00:01:19.941
"We're sinking!"

20
00:01:20.502 --> 00:01:21.202
Ezra cried.

21
00:01:21.222 --> 00:01:23.822
"And where are our paddles?"

22
00:01:24.483 --> 00:01:25.163
Ivy asked.

23
00:01:26.363 --> 00:01:29.324
The Blue team grabbed the floating paddles and handed them over.

24
00:01:30.448 --> 00:01:31.549
Annie kept sneezing.

25
00:01:31.569 --> 00:01:33.930
"Ah-choo! Ah-choo!"

26
00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:36.070
"Bless you!"

27
00:01:36.351 --> 00:01:36.951
Glen said.

28
00:01:36.971 --> 00:01:42.393
"Um Ivy looked nervously at the water in the bottom of the canoe.

29
00:01:42.413 --> 00:01:45.134
"We'd better paddle fast!"

30
00:01:46.535 --> 00:01:48.015
The Yellow team paddled hard.

31
00:01:49.096 --> 00:01:51.837
But soon their canoe was almost completely under water.

32
00:01:51.857 --> 00:01:53.578
"Hop out!"

33
00:01:53.778 --> 00:01:55.098
Penelope called from the shore.

34
00:01:55.118 --> 00:01:57.179
"Pull your canoe in by the rope!"

35
00:01:58.379 --> 00:01:59.320
The kids hopped out.

36
00:02:00.288 --> 00:02:03.510
Glen grabbed the rope tied to the front and pulled the canoe ashore.

37
00:02:04.531 --> 00:02:06.372
Ezra and Ivy walked out of the water.

38
00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:11.215
"At least you made it back safely," Penelope said.

39
00:02:11.235 --> 00:02:12.896
"But you were right.

40
00:02:13.576 --> 00:02:17.158
You guys need practice—lots and lots of practice!"

41
00:02:18.479 --> 00:02:23.042
"Even cheerful Penelope thinks we're a disaster," Ivy thought.

42
00:02:24.582 --> 00:02:26.744
Ivy, Glen, and Ezra were soaking wet.

43
00:02:27.936 --> 00:02:30.839
They walked back to their cabins to change into dry clothes.

44
00:02:37.284 --> 00:02:38.165
Ivy shook her head.

45
00:02:38.185 --> 00:02:41.547
"There's no way we'll win this race.

46
00:02:42.008 --> 00:02:43.969
The Blue team is super fast."

47
00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:47.432
"We have to win," Glen said.

48
00:02:47.452 --> 00:02:50.415
"I can taste that Colossal Cone now.

49
00:02:51.656 --> 00:02:54.258
Four scoops and six toppings will be mine!"

50
00:02:54.278 --> 00:02:57.781
"Come on, Ivy," Ezra said.

51
00:02:57.801 --> 00:02:59.542
"We need to try.

52
00:03:00.343 --> 00:03:02.965
It's not just a trip to Frosty Freeze."

53
00:03:03.926 --> 00:03:04.666
"What do you mean?"

54
00:03:05.167 --> 00:03:05.687
she asked.

55
00:03:05.707 --> 00:03:10.792
"The losers stay behind to play soccer," Ezra said.

56
00:03:10.812 --> 00:03:15.175
"Do you want to eat ice cream or play soccer?"

57
00:03:16.496 --> 00:03:18.038
Ivy hated soccer.

58
00:03:18.858 --> 00:03:20.860
There was too much running in the hot sun.

59
00:03:22.041 --> 00:03:24.123
And she always got hit on the head with the ball.

60
00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:27.081
Ivy nodded.

61
00:03:27.101 --> 00:03:29.923
"Okay, I'll try my hardest."

62
00:03:32.384 --> 00:03:35.346
The next morning the Yellow team was back at the lake in a canoe.

63
00:03:36.407 --> 00:03:39.990
From her own canoe, Penelope was teaching them different paddle strokes.

64
00:03:41.451 --> 00:03:44.012
"First, we'll do a J stroke," Penelope said.

65
00:03:44.032 --> 00:03:46.854
"Draw the letter J in the water."

66
00:03:48.295 --> 00:03:50.097
The kids copied Penelope's stroke.

67
00:03:51.318 --> 00:03:54.300
Just then Richard and Wes Wheezer paddled past them.

68
00:03:55.556 --> 00:03:57.477
"Hey, guys, where's Annie?"

69
00:03:57.957 --> 00:03:58.577
Ezra called.

70
00:03:58.597 --> 00:04:01.619
"She's sick," Richard said.

71
00:04:01.639 --> 00:04:03.359
"She's in the infirmary."

72
00:04:03.379 --> 00:04:05.880
"Did you hear that?"

73
00:04:06.541 --> 00:04:08.061
Glen grinned at his teammates.

74
00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:11.343
"If Annie's sick, maybe we can beat Blue!"

75
00:04:11.363 --> 00:04:13.484
"The infirmary?"

76
00:04:13.964 --> 00:04:14.504
Ivy said.

77
00:04:14.524 --> 00:04:17.045
"What do kids do in the infirmary?"

78
00:04:17.065 --> 00:04:20.707
"It's really boring," Glen said.

79
00:04:20.727 --> 00:04:23.348
"You spend the whole time in bed."

80
00:04:24.708 --> 00:04:27.370
"Sounds great to me," Ivy thought.

81
00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:31.613
"No canoeing, no soccer, no sports at all!"

82
00:04:31.633 --> 00:04:33.614
"Yellow team!"

83
00:04:33.935 --> 00:04:34.715
Penelope said.

84
00:04:34.735 --> 00:04:36.436
"Pay attention, please.

85
00:04:36.977 --> 00:04:38.358
We have more strokes to learn."

86
00:04:40.899 --> 00:04:42.461
Ivy waved her paddle in the air.

87
00:04:42.481 --> 00:04:45.403
"Penelope? I'm not feeling well.

88
00:04:46.483 --> 00:04:47.864
I need to get back to shore."

89
00:04:51.527 --> 00:04:54.770
As the kids paddled back, Ezra asked Ivy what was wrong.

90
00:04:56.271 --> 00:04:57.553
Ivy chuckled.

91
00:04:57.573 --> 00:04:58.974
"Nothing's wrong.

92
00:05:00.396 --> 00:05:03.419
In fact, everything's about to get much better!"

93
00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:09.004
When they reached shore, Ivy stepped out and took a few wobbly steps.

94
00:05:10.826 --> 00:05:13.689
Then she closed her eyes and pretended to faint.
